## Bounded original ask75 source: actual unscoped ancestor count before creation.
app AncestorCount
Given
 Conversation {title:text}
 Branch in Conversation {title:text}
 Run in Branch {unfinished:bool=true}
 policy Conversation read=members
 policy Branch read=members
 policy Run read=members
When
 scenario ask(branch:Branch) by=members -> Run
  require count(Run as run where run.parent.parent==branch.parent and run.unfinished)<10
  do
   create Run {parent=branch,unfinished=true} as run
   return run
Then
